#: ../../solid/brillouinzone.rst:146
msgid ""
"同じ記号でも、ブリルアンゾーンの形が違えば位置は違う。例えば単純立方格子のX点と面心立方格子のX点は、 それぞれの格子定数 :math:`a` で"
" :math:`2\\pi/a` を単位にした座標が2倍違う。文献や計算プログラムの高対称点を読むときは、どの格子のどの単位胞の "
"記号かを確かめる。"
msgstr ""
"The same label refers to different positions when the Brillouin zone "
"shape differs. For example, take the X points in the simple cubic and "
"face-centered cubic lattices. Using each lattice's own lattice constant "
":math:`a` to set the unit :math:`2\\pi/a`, their coordinates differ by a "
"factor of two. When looking up high-symmetry points in the literature or "
"a calculation program, check which lattice and unit cell the labels refer"
" to."

